00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:53.800
you got to go.

00:05:53.800 --> 00:05:57.290
Speaker 2: I would suggest to you
Speaker 1: that it's the exact

00:05:57.290 --> 00:05:59.139
Speaker 2: same thing when it comes
